=== SIGNATURE batman-lod/signatures/mod_fast_trains.toml ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "mod_fast_trains",
        display_name: "Bullet Trains",
        tagline: Some(
            "Gotham's L is now express service. Mind the gap.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "Every freeze tick (250 ms), walks GUObjectArray for every live TrackSplineComponent and stamps MoveSpeed to 2500 cm/s — 5× the stock 500. Trains travel their splines five times faster; you'll see them shoot across the elevated tracks. 36 live splines observed in HUB_GothamCity. This is a toggle rather than a slider because freeze_for_matching writes a fixed value per tick — exposing it as user-tunable would require a small runtime extension to read the input value dynamically. Toggle OFF stops the freeze; the next time a train despawns/respawns it picks up the original 500.",
