=== SIGNATURE batman-lod/signatures/mod_fly.toml ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "mod_fly",
        display_name: "Fly Mode",
        tagline: Some(
            "Take off. Gravity is a suggestion now.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "Freezes UCharacterMovementComponent::MovementMode at 5 (MOVE_Flying) on the live DinnerCharacterMovementComponent, every 16 ms (~60 Hz, matching the game's tick). A one-shot SetMovementMode UFunction call gets clobbered immediately by TT's per-tick BP logic — confirmed live: the call returned CallOk but the in-game state never changed. The freeze races the game's writes at tick cadence and wins. Controls: while toggled ON, use WASD + look to glide through the air; Space (jump) is consumed by PhysFlying and does nothing. Toggling OFF stops the freeze; the game's next BP tick restores MovementMode to Walking/Falling and gravity resumes — Batman will drop. Does not disable collision (no noclip).",
        ),
        icon: Some(
            "feather",
        ),
        icon_color: None,
        tier: "character movement",
        kind: "mod",
        discovered_in_version: Some(
            "1.0.0.1",
