=== SIGNATURE batman-lod/signatures/unlimited_focus.toml ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "unlimited_focus",
        display_name: "Unlimited Focus",
        tagline: Some(
            "Combo meter pegged at max. Every takedown is unlocked, always.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "GAS-aware freeze: resolves PlayerState→PawnPrivate→FocusAttributeSet→Focus (FGameplayAttributeData), then freezes Focus.CurrentValue at 9999 every 100 ms. Focus is the combat-combo meter that gates takedowns (`GA_TakeDownAttack_*_C` reads `RequiredFocusPercentageForUse`), perfect counters (`GA_PerfectCounterAbility_C::FocusBonus`), and the no-focus VO cue (`GA_NoFocusVO_C::FocusBarThreshold`). At cap, every focus-gated ability is always available — no need to build combos first. The struct layout matches HealthAttributeSet exactly: `{ vptr(+0); BaseValue f32(+8); CurrentValue f32(+12) }`, so the final hop carries `inner_offset = 12` to land on CurrentValue. PreAttributeChange may clamp to MaxFocus (driven by `FocusCapacity` attribute on the same set); that's fine — clamp-to-max IS the desired behavior. Toggling OFF stops the freeze; using a focus-consuming ability afterwards drains the meter normally and rebuilds via combat.",
