=== SIGNATURE glacier-007/signatures/god_mode.toml ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "god_mode",
        display_name: "God Mode",
        tagline: Some(
            "Untouchable — health pinned to the current difficulty's max.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "Freezes Bond's authoritative health value-box — the f32 the damage pipeline subtracts from and the death check reads, NOT the HUD / SCharacterOutput read-back mirror (freezing the mirror does not stop death). The box is a vtable-less heap allocation reached only through a Denuvo-hidden handle chain, so it is re-found each session by a structural [heap_scan] fingerprint rather than a static address or a pointer chain. The DLL-side freeze thread holds current health by copying the box's own max field (+0x04) every frame, so it is correct on every difficulty (effective max = base 100 x difficulty scale). Each write is read-before-write guarded: a freed/reused box (after a checkpoint reload re-lays the heap) is skipped, never corrupted.\n",
