=== SIGNATURE glacier-007/signatures/inf_ammo.ron ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "inf_ammo",
        display_name: "Infinite Ammo",
        tagline: Some(
            "Reload to refill — your spare ammo is topped up to max every time you reload, on any weapon.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "Patches the global reserve-consume routine (main_module+0x1A8A32B) so that on every reload the spare-ammo pool is SET to 600 instead of being decremented. Because the engine computes the per-ammo-type slot itself, this single code patch tops up whatever weapon you reload — pistol, rifle, etc. Pure code patch (Denuvo-safe on this title), auto-reverted on detach. Note: a weapon sitting at exactly 0 reserve can't bootstrap (the game blocks the reload before this routine runs) — pair with No Reload, which keeps that weapon's magazine full so it never needs reserve. Distinct from No Reload: that freezes the loaded magazine; this keeps the spare reserve topped up. Re-found each launch by an AOB unique in the image; on a game update re-derive the site via the FindWriter HW-breakpoint.\n",
        ),
        icon: None,
        icon_color: None,
        tier: "combat",
        kind: "trainer",
        discovered_in_version: None,
        verified_versions: [],
        discovered_on: None,
        discovered_by: None,
    },
    value: None,
    write: CodePatch {
        original_bytes: "2B 43 08 3B 4B 08 41 0F 46 C6",
        patched_bytes: "B8 58 02 00 00 90 90 90 90 90",
    },
    locator: Some(
        LocatorSpec {
            pattern: "48 0F AF 8A 68 06 00 00 48 8B 92 60 06 00 00 48 8D 0C 81 48 03 D1 8B 0A 8B C1 2B 43 08 3B 4B 08 41 0F 46 C6 89 02",
            resolve: Offset {
                delta: 26,
            },
            module: None,
        },
    ),
    heap_scan: None,
    reflection: None,
    pointer_chain: None,
    control: Some(
        Switch,
    ),
}

=== SIGNATURE glacier-007/signatures/no_reload.ron ===
SignatureSpec {
    meta: Meta {
        feature: "no_reload",
        display_name: "No Reload",
        tagline: Some(
            "Magazine never empties — fire forever without reloading.",
        ),
        description: Some(
            "NOPs the magazine-decrement instruction (`mov [rdx], ecx` at main_module+0x1A686A1, the write-back of clip-1 into the global per-weapon ammo array). With the store removed the clip never drops, so the weapon never needs to reload. Pure `.text` code patch (Denuvo-safe on this title), auto-reverted on detach. Distinct from Infinite Ammo: this freezes the loaded magazine; Infinite Ammo keeps the spare reserve topped up. Re-found each launch by an AOB unique in `.text`; on a game update re-derive the site via the FindWriter HW-breakpoint.\n",
